具遭公开暴露，已导致韩国金融业及微软云客户等多起大规模网络攻击。该工具为开源自主渗透测试系统，微软指出其攻击链可从侦察到数据窃取全程自动化，暴露原因包括弱密码和未启用多因素认证。Censys数据显示超过800个未授权实例长期暴露，部分攻击涉及支付和游戏公司。Artex 已宣布转为闭源，但仍有代码片段在GitHub可下载。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/06/hundreds-of-artex-ai-hacking-tools-found-publicly-exposed-to-the-web/","publishedAt":"2026-11-06T18:44:38.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"xlapf4l02155qke17u7hzkcpf","title":"Physicl获千万种子轮融资，推出机器人训练数据生成工具Studio","summary":"Physicl获千万种子轮融资，推出机器人训练数据生成工具Studio，支持用户通过10,000个3D环境和100,000个物体资产创建合成数据，解决机器人处理复杂场景的难题。早期客户SpAItial表示该工具可提升其产品Echo-3的仿真精度。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/06/physicl-raises-10m-to-make-the-digital-world-real-enough-for-robots/","publishedAt":"2026-11-06T13:00:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"zxq0f6laqzv5g650mxlrunevz","title":"OpenAI 与 Hacktron 合作寻找系统漏洞","summary":"OpenAI 与 Hacktron 合作，旨在发现系统漏洞、测试第三方服务连接并强化前沿AI防御。双方合作聚焦于安全机制验证与第三方接口兼容性测试，未提及具体成果或技术细节。","sourceName":"OpenAI News","sourceUrl":"https://openai.com/index/partnering-with-hacktron","publishedAt":"2026-11-06T08:00:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}]},{"label":"技巧与观点","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/a8b526f05467cb18292ebf1614548baa113724cc01f1f4f529c8f049e6db8990.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/b777cdeed6fba31300c6544ed687d426477163550534840b9d57cae84c1b4ea9.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/a8b526f05467cb18292ebf1614548baa113724cc01f1f4f529c8f049e6db8990.webp 96w","itemId":"rihs47h4er0orr9135aoivfxt","title":"GitHub Copilot 发布智能体工程开发者指