","summary":"OpenAI的GPT-6 Sol Daybreak在网络安全测试中表现最佳，Nova测试达成80.8%目标，Lighthouse测试完成27/31项任务。DeepSeek V4.1 Flash以72.8%的Nova测试成绩接近，单次运行成本仅$3（OpenAI Opus 4.5为$85）。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/the-gap-between-open-and-closed-ai-models-in-cyber-capabilities-keeps-shrinking/","publishedAt":"2026-11-07T15:35:50.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"aqf4fk6y4zqvlvya3ncqrmqom","title":"AWS旗下税务合规平台Taxbit发布基于Bedrock AgentCore的AI助手","summary":"AWS旗下税务合规平台Taxbit发布基于Bedrock AgentCore的AI助手，实现权限感知与合规安全。系统架构包含知识库检索（Cohere Embed English v3语义分块+AWS S3向量存储）、模型推理与权限校验三阶段。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/taxbit-assist-a-grounded-role-aware-ai-agent-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/","publishedAt":"2026-11-06T16:49:42.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/d8005acd58268e7cd7fda60d43e180921e5eb3ac716974f75571ef865eaf42e1.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp 96w","itemId":"ylh4b0qp1iv0b3nahcc97t27j","title":"OpenAI估值达1.25万亿美元，竞品Anthropic接近IPO","summary":"OpenAI在最新融资中估值达1.25万亿美元（Bloomberg数据），披露新一轮融资11亿美元及IPO计划调整。其竞品Anthropic上周已提交IPO文件，而OpenAI CEO Sam Altman表示IPO延迟因需更充分的安全声明和应对公众舆论变化。","sourceName":"The Verge · AI","sourceUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1029380/openai-1-25-trillion-investment-valuation","publishedAt":"2026-11-06T23:46:18.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"ljjv5vz0j7yo62iwloxb9pzbm","title":"Anthropic 为 Claude 新增个人财务管理功能","summary":"Anthropic 为 Claude 添加银行账户访问功能，用户可通过 Plaid 连接账户查看消费分类、检查待付账单，并验证收支平衡。Claude 仅限读权限且不存储密码，该功能现面向美国 Pro/Max/Ultra 用户进行测试。公司表示相关对话不会用于模型训练，长期计划接入持牌财务顾问和合规机构。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-adds-bank-account-access-to-claude-so-users-can-track-their-spending/","publishedAt":"2026-11-06T11:33:13.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"followUp":"2026-11-06"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"srvhxn06bnhe52tz3i48sj4zn","title":"Amazon Quick智能体原语分类框架发布","summary":"Amazon Quick发布智能体原语分类框架，包含触发器（When/What）、智能体（Who）、技能（How）和工作流（How）四大核心组件。触发器分为人工发起、代理转交、定时计划和外部事件驱动；智能体作为持续学习实体，包含指令、能力集和上下文记忆；技能提供结构化指导，工作流实现确定性流程。该框架通过组合不同组件满足用户从简单指令到合规级流程的多层次需求，并支持通过持续学习框架优化执行效果。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/taxonomy-of-agentic-primitives-in-amazon-quick/","publishedAt":"2026-11-06T17:34:45.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"pbnvlbgelsmnkgqze8ns95ucq","title":"AWS Bedrock AgentCore远程运行Claude Code任务及安全控制指南","summary":"AWS通过Bedrock AgentCore实现Claude Code远程任务运行，每个任务在独立微虚拟机中执行，使用临时IAM凭证调用Bedrock模型，并通过GitHub PR提交可审查的代码变更。安全控制包括零操作员访问（ZOA）、数据零保留（ZDR）、私有VPC网络、模型调用日志隔离等。部署需15-25分钟，支持本地Claude Code插件和网页控制台两种提交方式。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/extend-claude-code-to-remote-sessions-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore-with-security-controls/","publishedAt":"2026-11-06T16:45:58.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":8,"modelsReleased":0,"firstPartyEvents":5},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":"2026-11-07","next":"2026-11-11"}